# Media Player (shell/renderer/apps/media): playback, decoding (MP3, AAC/H.264, Opus, Vorbis, FLAC,
# VP8/VP9/AV1, WAV) and the WebAudio visualizer all come from Electron's bundled Chromium + FFmpeg,
# and metadata/artwork/thumbnails are read in JavaScript. No extra OS packages are needed.
# (Theora .ogv video is no longer decoded by Chromium: such files show a "format not supported" error.)
# Sample media for new users ship in rootfs/etc/skel/{Music,Videos} (generated by
# shell/tools/gen-media-samples.mjs).
